# e4m3 E16 "e4m3_shoot" (docs/design/mission-e4-03.md, Cinematic hooks; script-episodes-4-8/e4m3.md 1): 12 s at Final +
# 45 s, mode=pause over the live mission (the spec's HOLD runs as PAUSE). 1) Low ECU: one green shoot pushing out of black
# ash at the Heartglade's south edge (4, 15), frost melting off it (map point: a thin green pillar + a frost ring);
# 2) MS Torvald looking down at it, then up at Aldra, one hand raised (the hand is skipped until Motion Lab: spec
# fallback); his Rimeshields ground their shields (sfx). Orbits the live `torvald` (MissionE403.torvald); the cast stands
# by the shoot for cine's checks. Axis: the Ysolde - Torvald line (z = x); cameras on its SOUTH-WEST side.
# Lines: L22 (Torvald), L23 (Aldra), L24 (Torvald) (mission DIALOGUE, French in dialogue.po).
# Fallback: the end state says L22-L24 as dialogue cards; Torvald's group holds.
cine e4m3_shoot  title="A Shoot in the Ash"  mode=pause  letterbox=2.39  seed=93  length=10..14
env day  moon_yaw=160  moon_pitch=-18  energy=0.85
cast  torvald  res://art/units/wizards/torvald.tscn  at=(2, 0, 12)  yaw=34
cast  aldra    res://art/units/helpers/helper_aldra/helper_aldra.tscn  at=(-4, 0, 6)  yaw=60

# Low ECU: a green shoot out of the black ash, the frost melting off it
shot S1 5.0  cam=dolly  from=(2.6, 0.35, 16.8)  to=(2.9, 0.3, 16.4)  look=(4, 0.2, 15)>(4, 0.3, 15)  fov=34>30  in=fade_black:0.5
  at 0.2  vfx shoot  scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/green_pillar.tscn  at=(4, 0, 15)  life=4.6  scale=0.08
  at 0.3  vfx melt  scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/freeze_wave.tscn  at=(4, 0.05, 15)  life=3.0  scale=0.3
  at 0.3  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/ice_creak.wav  vol=-10
  at 0.4  line torvald "Aldra. Look. A shoot, in the ash. After all of that."
# MS Torvald looking down at it, then up at Aldra, one hand raised
shot S2 7.0  cam=orbit  pivot=torvald  r=4.0  h=1.6  deg=96>112
  at 0.3  line aldra "It's a weed, Torvald."
  at 3.0  line torvald "We were all weeds once. Pull back."
  at 3.6  sfx res://assets/audio/sfx/ab_hold_the_line.wav  vol=-8
  at 6.4  fade alpha=1 time=0.6
